      "settings": {
        "enable_dark": false,
        "subheading": "<p><strong>JOIN US</strong></p>",
        "title": "<p>A Study In Colour </p>",
        "description": "<p><strong>Our First Gemstone Trunk Show | 2–4 October | Paddington Showroom</strong></p><p>For the first time, we invite you to experience <strong>A Study in Colour</strong> — Natalie Marie Jewellery’s inaugural Gemstone Trunk Show.</p><p>For three days only, discover a curated collection of one-of-a-kind natural gemstones, alongside exclusive finished pieces created especially for the occasion. Our most-loved signatures have been reimagined through colour, with new Eirene designs also making their debut.</p><p>From luminous yellow sapphires and Ceylon sapphires to vivid blue topaz and rich pink garnets, each gemstone has been selected for its individual colour, character and natural beauty.</p>",
        "feature_text": "<p><em>Mark </em>a birth month, <em>honour </em>a milestone, <em>capture </em>the memory of a loved one, or be <em>guided </em>by the stone you can't leave behind.</p>",
        "colour_style": "dark",
        "button_1_metaobject": "",
        "button_1_text": "",
        "button_1_link": "https://nataliemariejewellery.as.me/schedule/62dbb371",
        "button_2_metaobject": "",
        "button_2_text": "",
        "button_2_link": "https://nataliemariejewellery.as.me/schedule/62dbb371",
        "button_style": "primary"
      }
    },
    "b2f993b2-b2ff-4017-9547-f8bfa906ef33": {
      "type": "content-list",
      "blocks": {
        "image_7z4Wkw": {
          "type": "image",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "apply_overlay": false,
            "devices": "mobile_desktop",
            "content_position": "middleLeft",
            "subheading": "<p><strong>JOIN US IN SYDNEY</strong></p>",
            "title": "",
            "description": "<p>Join us for an intimate 30-minute appointment at a private Sydney residence in the heart of Paddington where you will have the opportunity to collaborate with our expert Bespoke Design Team. Together, we’ll bring your unique vision to life with unparalleled craftsmanship and personalised attention, offering you a glimpse into the creative artistry that defines NMJ.</p><p>Our team will be bringing a curated selection of ceremonial and wedding day jewellery. If you have ever dreamed of styling our pieces for your special day, we warmly invite you to join us for a personalised and intimate experience.</p>",
            "description_mobile": "<p>Join us for an intimate 30-minute appointment at a private Sydney residence in the heart of Paddington where you will have the opportunity to collaborate with our expert Bespoke Design Team. Together, we’ll bring your unique vision to life with unparalleled craftsmanship and personalised attention, offering you a glimpse into the creative artistry that defines NMJ.</p><p>Our team will be bringing a curated selection of ceremonial and wedding day jewellery. If you have ever dreamed of styling our pieces for your special day, we warmly invite you to join us for a personalised and intimate experience.</p>",
            "colour_style": "dark",
            "button_1_metaobject": "",
